WEBVTT

00:00:10.540 --> 00:00:14.660
I guess it's true that Kiyoi-chan 
really cares about her friends.

00:00:15.480 --> 00:00:17.740
She was pissed.

00:00:17.960 --> 00:00:22.210
Kiyoi-chan will do anything for a friend.

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:24.500
I'm glad she hasn't changed.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:27.750
Do you really think you can 
get away with doing this?

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:29.710
This is a crime!

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:32.000
So what?

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.970
Once I've beaten the shit out of her,

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:38.330
I'll take some embarrassing photos 
so you can't go to the cops.

00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:41.220
Gosh, Akira-chan's such a monster!

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:45.480
You'd go that far? Just because 
you can't beat in her battle?

00:00:45.900 --> 00:00:47.440
Shut up!

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:55.490
That bitch always slowed me down.

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:58.400
If it weren't for her, I could've won!

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:01.040
My wish would've come true!

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:03.590
I'll never forgive her!

00:01:03.590 --> 00:01:08.050
I'll make her suffer so much, 
she'll never think of disobeying me again!

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:10.290
What are you going to do to Kiyoi?

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:13.170
She and I are going to battle, that's all.

00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:18.960
Well, with you as my hostage, 
there's no way I can lose.

00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:22.070
You're wasting your time.

00:01:22.070 --> 00:01:24.680
Nobody's coming to save you.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:28.280
<i>Kiyoi...</i>

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:32.440
<i>Amika...</i>

00:03:06.480 --> 00:03:10.260
We got Yuzuki back, but she's still an LRIG.

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:12.630
What can we do to make her human again?

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:15.090
What if we got five coins?

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:18.820
Layla had five, and nothing really changed...

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:23.140
There are too many rules we don't know!

00:03:26.260 --> 00:03:27.720
What's wrong?

00:03:27.720 --> 00:03:30.230
Maybe she'd know!

00:03:30.230 --> 00:03:30.520
Mizushima Kiyoi

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:31.230
Mizushima Kiyoi

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:56.340
You're finally here.

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:58.090
I was getting tired of waiting.

00:03:58.700 --> 00:04:02.530
Akira-chan, introduce me, too!

00:04:02.530 --> 00:04:04.700
Huh? God, you're annoying.

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:08.260
Hello again, Kiyoi-chan!

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:09.830
Remember!

00:04:09.830 --> 00:04:11.880
I haven't seen you since that day!

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:17.400
I've been wanting to see you 
again for a long, long time.

00:04:17.800 --> 00:04:20.190
I wanted to play with you again.

00:04:20.680 --> 00:04:23.240
Our positions are reversed from last time,

00:04:23.240 --> 00:04:25.070
but we finally meet!

00:04:26.330 --> 00:04:27.900
Where's Amika?

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:30.120
Who knows?

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.200
She might not be here, I can tell you that.

00:04:36.420 --> 00:04:41.460
If you want her back, 
do what I tell you, okay?

00:04:41.760 --> 00:04:43.640
Got it?

00:04:43.640 --> 00:04:45.400
What's your answer?

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:47.600
Fine.

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:49.680
You mean, "Yes, ma'am!"

00:04:52.510 --> 00:04:54.410
Yes... ma'am.

00:04:55.240 --> 00:04:57.810
I love girls who are obedient!

00:04:57.810 --> 00:05:01.460
Now, I think it's time you battled me.

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:06.490
But you need to become an LRIG 
and just let me attack you.

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:09.820
As for what will happen 
to her if you hit back...

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:11.760
Well, you can guess, right?

00:05:12.050 --> 00:05:13.860
Don't worry!

00:05:13.860 --> 00:05:16.060
Kiyoi-chan cares about her friend.

00:05:16.060 --> 00:05:18.630
She'll do what you say.

00:05:19.090 --> 00:05:23.380
You used me to get revenge 
for your friend, right?

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:26.970
So you should be able to do what 
I tell you this time, right?

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:29.370
For your friend.

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:34.270
Okay, let's get started.

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:37.690
Open!

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:47.740
Hey, when are you going to let me have 
a real battle with Kominato Ruuko?

00:05:48.080 --> 00:05:50.830
Eventually, I promise.

00:05:50.830 --> 00:05:54.120
You did me a big favor, and I appreciate it.

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:55.840
Just words?

00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:59.880
I held back against a powerful 
foe like that for you!

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:01.720
I know.

00:06:01.720 --> 00:06:04.280
I ordered a pizza to thank you.

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:05.020
What?!

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:07.400
We're not friends.

00:06:07.400 --> 00:06:09.500
And I'm definitely not working for you.

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:10.760
Don't forget that!

00:06:10.760 --> 00:06:12.330
Of course.

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:14.990
There was something I wanted to see.

00:06:14.990 --> 00:06:17.650
And I got the confirmation I wanted.

00:06:17.650 --> 00:06:19.600
She's the keyhole.

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:21.460
Keyhole?

00:06:22.270 --> 00:06:24.570
Hello, I'm from Pizza Hattori.

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.680
Great, thanks.

00:06:26.680 --> 00:06:28.970
Right on time as always, I see.

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:29.780
Thank you.

00:06:30.430 --> 00:06:33.410
Just be a good girl until 
the stage is set, okay?

00:06:34.320 --> 00:06:35.540
Hey, wait!

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:48.130
So that's the kind of 
underwear you like, Suzuko?

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:50.220
M-Meru!

00:06:50.840 --> 00:06:52.720
What did Chinatsu wear?

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.180
Chi-chan's was...

00:06:55.090 --> 00:06:56.350
Wow, really?

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.320
What? What?

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:00.810
It's probably better that 
you don't know, Suzuko.

00:07:00.810 --> 00:07:01.520
Yeah...

00:07:01.850 --> 00:07:04.480
Jeez, you guys are mean!

00:07:09.200 --> 00:07:11.480
It feels strange,

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:14.420
talking to both of you at once.

00:07:14.420 --> 00:07:15.580
Yeah.

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:20.580
When I learned your name 
was Meru, I was happy.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.440
I realized Chi-chan hadn't forgotten.

00:07:24.970 --> 00:07:27.550
Suzu, about Chinatsu's memories...

00:07:28.810 --> 00:07:31.260
Yeah. I know.

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:34.980
I want to respect her feelings.

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:35.720
But...

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:41.220
Honestly, I don't know if it's for the best.

00:07:42.720 --> 00:07:45.840
But I will give her an answer.

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:48.150
Because we're friends.

00:07:57.550 --> 00:08:01.160
Okay, let's start by having 
you become an LRIG.

00:08:01.660 --> 00:08:04.170
And no using defensive ARTS.

00:08:04.630 --> 00:08:05.880
Kiyoi...

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:10.700
Unlock. Coin bet.

00:08:20.780 --> 00:08:22.060
Turn end.

00:08:27.570 --> 00:08:29.400
It's finally time!

00:08:29.880 --> 00:08:32.780
I can finally beat the shit out of you!

00:08:33.160 --> 00:08:36.660
Let's have fun until her 
Life Cloth is all gone!

00:08:36.950 --> 00:08:39.790
I'm going to pound you 
until you can barely stand,

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:42.540
then turn you into a card 
and rip you in half!

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:46.780
Or maybe we could stuff 
her in a diary somewhere.

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:49.610
Now, go, Remember.

00:08:49.610 --> 00:08:50.690
Attack.

00:08:50.690 --> 00:08:52.380
Got it!

00:08:58.160 --> 00:08:59.260
That's the face!

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:01.100
That's the face I wanted to see!

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:02.890
Kiyoi-chan, the girl who loves her friends...

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:05.390
Kiyoi-chan, the girl who's so stupid...

00:09:06.230 --> 00:09:09.610
Kiyoi-chan, the girl I love!

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:12.130
Kiyoi!

00:09:13.370 --> 00:09:14.940
I'm fine.

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:15.700
But...

00:09:16.400 --> 00:09:18.150
Turn end.

00:09:18.150 --> 00:09:21.450
Now stop wasting time and say it.

00:09:22.950 --> 00:09:24.280
Turn end.

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:26.490
Kiyoi, don't you understand?

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:30.030
They're going to own you!

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:33.410
Still, I can't fight.

00:09:34.270 --> 00:09:36.310
If I do, Amika will...

00:09:37.520 --> 00:09:39.440
I won't fight.

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.310
I have to protect Amika.

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:47.360
I'll make a contract with you.

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:50.770
I'll teach you how to fight.

00:09:51.220 --> 00:09:55.450
You memorize what I teach you and put 
it into practice as fast as possible.

00:09:55.960 --> 00:09:57.000
Do you understand?

00:09:57.000 --> 00:09:58.610
U-Um...

00:09:59.350 --> 00:10:03.260
You're weak, so if you want 
to win, it's the only way.

00:10:04.040 --> 00:10:06.790
I'll help you win.

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:08.670
Okay!

00:10:09.100 --> 00:10:10.860
Even in my battle with Remember,

00:10:10.860 --> 00:10:13.760
when I tried to take advantage of the rules

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:15.950
and deliberately lose to grant that wish,

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:16.800
Amika said...

00:10:17.530 --> 00:10:22.640
Amika, will you believe 
in me just one more time?

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:25.640
Yes... Kiyoi!

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:29.650
<b>We Recommend Grape</b>

00:10:25.640 --> 00:10:29.650
<b>No. 1 Orange Green Tea Mushroom
No. 2 Custard Cola
No. 3 Banana Chocolate Cilantro</b>

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:29.650
I think we should try 
orange green tea mushroom.

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:32.350
Banana chocolate cilantro.

00:10:32.350 --> 00:10:35.530
No, it's gotta be orange green tea mushroom!

00:10:36.140 --> 00:10:37.780
Banana chocolate cilantro.

00:10:39.010 --> 00:10:40.600
Okay...

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:44.490
Excuse me! I'd like a 
banana chocolate cilantro.

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:52.220
Why do you always believe in me, Amika?

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:56.920
You've never doubted me, 
even during the Selector battles.

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:57.710
Why?

00:10:57.990 --> 00:11:00.060
I don't know how to answer that...

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:02.300
Because we're friends?

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:03.360
Is that all?

00:11:03.360 --> 00:11:05.430
What other reason do I need?

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:09.260
My mom was saved because I believed you.

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:12.620
And that's why we're here now.

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:15.190
I've never gone wrong 
believing in you, Kiyoi.

00:11:15.430 --> 00:11:16.530
Amika...

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:21.840
Try some of this banana chocolate cilantro!

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:24.830
I believed in your choice, 
and it turned out to be delicious!

00:11:25.520 --> 00:11:28.540
Amika was willing to believe 
in someone like me...

00:11:29.590 --> 00:11:31.790
And I put her in danger.

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:34.670
Even though she's so important to me...

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:40.560
Remember what I told you?
I'll help you in any way I can.

00:11:40.560 --> 00:11:44.220
But I won't help you sacrifice yourself!

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:46.680
I'm sorry.

00:11:47.040 --> 00:11:47.940
But...

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:53.310
I'd rather disappear than lose Amika.

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:55.230
No...

00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:58.820
What are you babbling about?

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:00.860
It's my turn.

00:12:01.660 --> 00:12:03.360
Go, Remember!

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:04.780
'Kay!

00:12:11.880 --> 00:12:15.500
Playing with you sure is fun!

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:19.630
Don't overdo it, or you'll ruin the fun.

00:12:20.240 --> 00:12:21.840
I know!

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:24.800
Amika...

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:33.270
Kiyoi!

00:12:38.420 --> 00:12:39.980
Come on, Kiyoi-chan!

00:12:39.980 --> 00:12:42.360
Let's play even more!

00:12:48.310 --> 00:12:50.080
This is wonderful!

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:53.380
Lucky, lucky me!

00:12:53.380 --> 00:12:55.750
Lucky, lucky Akira!

00:13:03.170 --> 00:13:04.130
Kiyoi...

00:13:05.170 --> 00:13:08.210
<i>If you just fight and not
worry about me, you'll...</i>

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:10.850
<i>But I know she won't!</i>

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:14.810
<i>That's not who she is!</i>

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:22.320
What's wrong, Amika?

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:25.700
It's nothing.

00:13:26.080 --> 00:13:28.360
<i>Kiyoi forced herself to 
carry so many burdens</i>

00:13:28.360 --> 00:13:30.020
<i>and fought all by herself.</i>

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:31.660
<i>So I...</i>

00:13:34.560 --> 00:13:36.440
<i>So I can also...</i>

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:47.510
Are we done already, Kiyoi-chan?

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:50.420
This is so much fun!

00:13:50.420 --> 00:13:53.760
It feels so good to beat someone 
up when they can't fight back!

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:56.350
It's like it's always my turn!

00:13:58.280 --> 00:13:59.980
Stop it!

00:14:01.220 --> 00:14:03.230
Now, now, don't do that.

00:14:03.230 --> 00:14:06.730
I want to play with Kiyoi-chan!

00:14:06.730 --> 00:14:09.410
You have a wish, don't you, Kiyoi?

00:14:09.970 --> 00:14:12.290
To end this cycle of darkness!

00:14:13.100 --> 00:14:13.950
Piruluk...

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:16.240
Get lost!

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:20.000
Don't forget, I've got a hostage!

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:23.040
Oh, Piruluk-chan!

00:14:23.040 --> 00:14:25.180
You're such a noble friend, aren't you?

00:14:25.180 --> 00:14:27.450
Don't bother resisting.

00:14:27.450 --> 00:14:29.860
Just give up already!

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:35.730
Just stop...

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:38.550
I can't...

00:14:39.240 --> 00:14:40.810
Kiyoi!

00:14:41.760 --> 00:14:43.770
Kiyoi!

00:14:44.720 --> 00:14:45.650
Amika?!

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:48.220
Kiyoi!

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:49.100
Damn it.

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:50.360
She escaped!

00:14:51.430 --> 00:14:52.820
I'm fine!

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:54.700
I'm not hurt!

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:57.410
Amika...

00:14:58.400 --> 00:14:59.210
I'm sorry!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.200
Kiyoi!

00:15:02.560 --> 00:15:06.300
I'm not a Selector, so I can't help you...

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:09.930
It hurt to let you fight alone.

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:14.680
But if protecting myself can help you...

00:15:16.160 --> 00:15:18.770
I believe in you!

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:21.230
So believe in me, too!

00:15:21.680 --> 00:15:23.030
And fight!

00:15:24.680 --> 00:15:26.150
Amika...

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:28.310
Shut the hell up.

00:15:28.310 --> 00:15:29.650
It was just getting good.

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:31.680
Don't get in my way!

00:15:33.090 --> 00:15:35.000
Your attack is over, right?

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:39.000
Then declare it.

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:42.580
Turn end.

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:46.510
It's my turn.

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:47.440
Grow.

00:15:49.040 --> 00:15:50.760
Summon two Manomin.

00:15:51.250 --> 00:15:53.130
You have one coin left.

00:15:53.720 --> 00:15:57.720
Do you know what happens 
when you lose all your coins?

00:15:58.000 --> 00:15:58.800
Shut up.

00:15:58.800 --> 00:15:59.980
I don't care.

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:01.850
You disappear.

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:03.730
Your entire existence.

00:16:04.010 --> 00:16:04.790
Huh?

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:06.990
Jeez, Kiyoi-chan...

00:16:06.990 --> 00:16:09.080
Don't tell her that.

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:12.110
I was going to tell her at the right time.

00:16:12.570 --> 00:16:16.280
A Selector who loses all 
their coins disappears...

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:17.710
from this world.

00:16:17.710 --> 00:16:19.950
Literally, there's nothing left!

00:16:20.520 --> 00:16:22.290
What?

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:25.890
Until now, I was still uncertain.

00:16:26.360 --> 00:16:28.940
Even if I had to do it to 
end the Selector battles,

00:16:28.940 --> 00:16:31.010
I didn't know if it was okay to go that far.

00:16:31.340 --> 00:16:33.720
But I won't hesitate anymore.

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:37.790
For my own sake, and for the 
sake of everyone I know,

00:16:37.790 --> 00:16:39.720
I'm going to end these Selector battles!

00:16:40.600 --> 00:16:41.790
So...

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:43.180
I won't lose to you!

00:16:43.420 --> 00:16:46.440
Are you saying you're going to 
make Akira-chan disappear?

00:16:49.360 --> 00:16:50.690
This is great!

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:52.430
I'll disappear?

00:16:52.430 --> 00:16:53.820
Fine by me!

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:59.080
I don't give a shit if I lose this 
rotten life and all these scars!

00:16:59.830 --> 00:17:00.890
Piruluk.

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:02.070
Right.

00:17:02.070 --> 00:17:03.920
Worst Condition!

00:17:11.080 --> 00:17:12.050
Turn end.

00:17:12.280 --> 00:17:13.320
All right!

00:17:13.320 --> 00:17:15.380
Let's do this! Coin bet!

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:16.510
Astrology!

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:22.880
I'll find out exactly 
what your next attack is.

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:26.350
I can tell you...

00:17:27.460 --> 00:17:28.480
that I can't tell you!

00:17:29.200 --> 00:17:31.510
Are you trying to pick a fight with me?

00:17:31.510 --> 00:17:33.600
No, the result of the fortune-telling

00:17:33.600 --> 00:17:37.490
was that we don't know what 
her next attack will be.

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:40.420
Huh? What the hell?!

00:17:40.420 --> 00:17:42.200
I'll tell you.

00:17:42.630 --> 00:17:45.330
Unlock. Coin bet.

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:53.760
Piru-run's taking a break, 
and Milulun is here!

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:55.590
Milulun, coin bet.

00:17:55.820 --> 00:17:57.500
Happening!

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:01.180
You stole that from me!

00:18:10.920 --> 00:18:12.120
I'm going to disappear?

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:14.650
I'm really going to disappear?

00:18:15.390 --> 00:18:17.940
That can't be real... No way.

